      * ACCEPTED-OVD REGISTRY (SHARED). SEE RBI KYC DIRECTIONS 5(XIV).
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-OVD-CODE PIC X(3) VALUE 'PSP'.
           88  ACCEPTED-OVD VALUES 'PSP' 'DLC' 'ADH' 'VTR' 'NRG' ''.

